Package: codepill
Version: __VERSION__
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, python3-gi-cairo, python3-cairo, libgtk-3-0t64 | libgtk-3-0, librsvg2-common
Recommends: xdg-utils
Installed-Size: __SIZE__
Maintainer: Jack <wangzhenghao0410@163.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/ALEforwind/code-pill
Description: floating desktop widget for snippets and command lines
 CodePill puts a small always-on-top pill in the corner of your desktop.
 Click it to browse the code snippets and shell commands you saved, then
 click any item to copy it to the clipboard in one step. Snippets are
 stored locally in ~/.config/codepill/snippets.json, support tags, search,
 pinning, import and export, and can be edited right inside the panel.
 .
 The widget is frameless, translucent and remembers its position. Under
 GNOME Wayland it runs through XWayland so that it can stay on top.
 .
 代码贴：悬浮在桌面角落的小胶囊，点开后即可看到保存的代码 / 命令行，
 单击任意条目一键复制；支持搜索、标签、置顶、导入导出和就地编辑，
 数据只保存在本机。
